  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Meteor is a former forest warden from Kazimierz, an amazing archer with extensive experience in tracking and wilderness survival. \nShe serves as a frontline sniper for Rhodes Island concurrent with her medical treatment.",
        "zh": "前卡西米尔守林人，拥有高超的弓箭技巧，并且在追踪和野外生存方面拥有丰富经验。 \n现于罗德岛接受治疗的同时，作为狙击干员活跃在第一线。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging tests for this Operator showed blurry outlines of internal organs with visible dark spots. Unusually high concentrations of Originium particles were present in her circulatory system, indicating infection and confirming her as Infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 5% \nCurrently no visible symptoms. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.24u/L \nMinor stage of infection, currently no discernible physical effects.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓模糊，可见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测异常，有矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】5% \n体表暂未出现明显的源石病病征。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.24u/L \n感染程度尚浅，暂时还没有带来明显身体影响。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Meteor is an easy-going forest warden. \nTime was, she and her fellow wardens protected the endless forests of Kazimierz, until she contracted Oripathy and was forced into exile. She joined Rhodes Island after several stops in between. \nKind and caring, Meteor loves big get-togethers and often takes the lead herself. Despite her age, she is very reliable.",
        "zh": "潇洒的守林人。 \n曾经和伙伴们守护过卡西米尔的广阔森林，感染矿石病后，被迫背井离乡，几经辗转，最终加入罗德岛。 \n为人温和且善解人意，喜欢集体活动并且经常会主动组织，虽然年轻，但十分可靠。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Meteor doesn't care much for electronic devices. \nTrying to get some gizmo to work is worse than having Oripathy to her. Naturally, coming to Rhodes Island was quite a culture shock for her; more than most any other new operator. \nEven after all this time, she still avoids electronics.",
        "zh": "流星十分不习惯电子器械。 \n对她来说，操控这些东西似乎是比感染了矿石病还要头疼的事，这使得她最初加入罗德岛时，遇到了和其他人全然不同的水土不服问题。 \n事实上即使到了现在，流星已经成为了资深干员，她也在尽可能避免使用电子器械。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "As composite bows replace the traditional kind, Meteor bucks the trend by sticking to the old ways. \nIt is to her a commemoration of her past, the other forest wardens who fought with her, and her life in the woods. \nGiven her skill, she easily meets expected damage output metrics without the advantages provided by a composite bow.",
        "zh": "在复合弓逐渐取代反曲弓的潮流下，流星依然坚持使用反曲弓。 \n一方面，这对她来说是一种纪念，纪念过去共同战斗的伙伴，以及在森林中的生活。 \n另一方面，以她的能力，即使没有复合弓的各种辅助，也能达到符合战术标准甚至在那之上的杀伤力。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 4",
        "zh": "档案资料四",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "After leaving the forest, Meteor wandered for a long time. She went endured the hardships of the modern world and saw how much the people feared Oripathy. \nNone of that made her lose faith, though. She finally found Rhodes Island and requested to serve as an operator while undergoing treatment. Rhodes Island couldn't turn away a talent like her.",
        "zh": "在离开森林后，无处可去的流星流浪了一段时间，不习惯现代社会生活的她饱尝了世间冷暖，也发现了人们对矿石病的恐惧。 \n不过这些都没有让她对生活失去信心，她最后找到了罗德岛，希望能够在作为干员工作的同时，接受治疗，罗德岛自然不会拒绝这样的人才。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "200"
    }
  ]
}
